1
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,440
Wait, where are you going?

2
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,320
I'm just trying to tuck you in.

3
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,600
Come visit again when you're free.

4
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:18,720
Grandpa, I'm not leaving soon.

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,560
Who was talking to you?

6
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,440
Grandpa...

7
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,000
Just who is your actual grandson here?

8
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,160
Hey.

9
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,560
Want to try dating?

10
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,800
Whether I like women or not,

11
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,440
there's no way we could be together.

12
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,680
I've endured this for long enough.

13
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:56,840
P'Ing.

14
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,800
I've put up with you for long enough,

15
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,520
and that's only because of Itt.

16
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,520
If you keep acting like this,

17
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,600
I'll make you regret it for the rest of your life.

18
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,320
Oh...

19
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,960
How terrifying.

20
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:12,000
Weren't you into it with me last night?

21
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,039
Now you're acting all disgusted.

22
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:14,800
Why...

23
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,960
If you hadn't forced yourself on me,

24
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,320
I never would've done that.

25
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,760
If you weren't Itt's brother,

26
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,680
I would have punched you a long time ago.

27
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:25,880
Really?

28
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:29,000
You think I'm scared?

29
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,360
I get it now.

30
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:36,360
You like it rough, don't you?

31
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,360
Fine. Give me some time to do some research.

32
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,120
Hold on.

33
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,560
To be honest,

34
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,039
I've never done it in the office before.

35
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,080
Care to give it a try?

36
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,400
Dammit.

37
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,360
Still want to fight?

38
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,840
I can do this all day.

39
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:10,759
Good boy.

40
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,520
How do you know I've never done it here?

41
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,920
Get those filthy thoughts out of your head.

42
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,760
Oh, my head is full of them.

43
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:22,960
Why? Do you prefer being on top?

44
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,520
I've got plenty of other positions.

45
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,760
On your side or face down...

46
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,840
Whatever you want, I can make it happen.

47
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:30,440
Listen to yourself. Do you have no shame?

48
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,400
That's my business.

49
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,360
I can do whatever I want.

50
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:34,400
Stop me if you can.

51
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,440
Ow.

52
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:42,120
You've got a lot of strength, you jerk.

53
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,680
You're so damn shameless.

54
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,120
Why?

55
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,720
What's wrong with me?

56
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:53,120
My looks, my body, my education, or my status?

57
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,480
I'm great in bed, too.

58
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,240
I just proved it to you last night, didn't I?

59
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,680
You came a little too fast, though.

60
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,520
Want me to help you work on that?

61
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:01,560
Go to hell.

62
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,120
Who is it?

63
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,480
It's me, Itt.

64
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,000
What is it?

65
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,520
Is Yok in there?

66
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,840
I just wanted to ask

67
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,520
if he'd like to have lunch with me.

68
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,760
We're busy with work. Go on ahead.

69
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,680
Should I buy some for you?

70
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,160
From that place P'Ing said was good.

71
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,520
Sure.

72
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,680
What about you, P'Ing?

73
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:27,960
Don't bother.

74
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,680
I'll find something myself.

75
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,440
P'Ing, can I come in?

76
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:35,760
P'Ing?

77
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:37,880
What did I tell you?

78
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,800
Don't make me say it again.

79
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:43,440
Itt, go ahead and have lunch.

80
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,520
When you talk to Itt,

81
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,680
why do you have to be so gentle?

82
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,960
Because Itt isn't like you.

83
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,680
What are you going to do?

84
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:05,840
What about you?

85
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,760
Want another round?

86
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,160
Go fix your hair in the other room

87
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,760
and iron your clothes.

88
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,400
Where did he get all that strength?

89
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:34,760
Hey.

90
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,840
What's taking you so long?

91
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,760
This isn't a hotel, you know.

92
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,320
Hey.

93
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:49,200
I need to talk to you.

94
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:02,560
I'll admit, I was partly to blame for what happened.

95
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:06,000
But at the end of the day, it's because...

96
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,640
you're just too narrow-minded, isn't it?

97
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:12,000
Alright, regardless of who's right or wrong,

98
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:14,120
from now on,

99
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,440
I won't force you into anything anymore, okay?

100
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,120
Let's have a fresh start.

101
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:19,760
We'll be nothing

102
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:21,040
more than a boss and an intern.

103
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,280
You just focus on your internship,

104
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,680
and I'll focus on mentoring you.

105
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,160
Is that okay?

106
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,160
What now?

107
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,040
That's good.

108
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:37,400
If that's all, put on your shirt and get out.

109
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,640
He's so damn serious.

110
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,680
Come in.

111
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:14,280
P'Ing, it's me.

112
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:15,960
Yeah.

113
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,560
What is it?

114
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:27,880
Are you and Yok okay?

115
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:35,920
Why wouldn't we be?

116
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,960
I just gave him an earful.

117
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,360
He won't dare mess up his work again.

118
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,200
I see.

119
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,280
Secretary Piang just called me.

120
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:47,640
Yok's brother's people got in touch

121
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:48,960
regarding the land in Pattaya.

122
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,520
They said...

123
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:53,720
we can visit the site next month.

124
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:54,840
Oh, really?

125
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:58,040
Alright. At least there's some good news.

126
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,480
Are you going to Pattaya?

127
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:08,080
Of course. This is a major project.

128
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,480
I've gotta check out the land myself.

129
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,680
Can I come along?

130
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,920
What for?

131
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:17,040
We're not going on vacation.

132
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,320
It's enough with just me and Yok.

133
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:24,480
But I want to learn about this project, too.

134
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,000
Please, P'Ing.

135
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,720
Maybe next time.

136
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,640
Grab me the ashtray.

137
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:37,880
Okay.

138
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,560
Put it right here.

139
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:47,600
Okay.

140
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,120
You can go now.

141
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,720
P'Ing...

142
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:57,160
I don't know

143
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,960
what you and Yok were fighting about,

144
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:01,880
but please don't be too hard on him.

145
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,600
You sure know a lot, huh?

146
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,080
Fine.

147
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,800
You can come to Pattaya with us

148
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,680
so Yok will have a friend around.

149
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,480
Really, P'Ing?

150
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,280
You're the best.

151
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:26,040
You look a bit tired, though.

152
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,560
Let me give you a massage.

153
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,760
No...

154
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:32,720
No need.

155
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:35,800
I'm not tired. Go.

156
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:37,440
I'm going back to work. Leave now.

157
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,600
Okay.

158
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,240
See you, then.

159
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,320
Yeah, just go.

160
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,880
That was hard.

161
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,280
It hurt, you little brat.

162
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:14,880
What is this?

163
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:17,920
This room is cramped and smells musty.

164
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,320
Open the window.

165
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,080
Okay.

166
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:29,600
This is the hotel P'Phet arranged for us.

167
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,680
If it's not up to your standards,

168
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:36,080
feel free to book a five-star hotel at your own expense.

169
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,680
Actually, this room isn't bad.

170
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,800
Don't you think so, Itt?

171
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,720
The view is nice, too.

172
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:41,840
It's perfectly fine.

173
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,080
Just bear with it, P'Ing.

174
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,640
But if you really can't stand it,

175
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,840
Don't say another word.

176
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:48,560
Since Mr. Phet booked this hotel for us,

177
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:49,640
it's bound to be good.

178
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:53,360
One night won't hurt.

179
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:55,160
Mr. Ing,

180
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,960
P'Phet has invited us for a meal tomorrow.

181
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,560
For today, we'll have to eat the hotel buffet.

182
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,640
Are you okay with that?

183
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,840
I'm not.

184
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,040
Since we're here,

185
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,520
I want something more local.

186
00:13:05,160 --> 00:13:07,720
I'll order some seafood for you, then.

187
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:11,000
Actually, I'm not even that hungry yet.

188
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:15,800
Never mind. I'm not really hungry.

189
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,160
I'll go for a walk on the beach.

190
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,160
May I come along?

191
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:20,120
Sure.

192
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,840
You know this city better than I do.

193
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:23,200
Right.

194
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:25,400
Let's go.

195
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:26,640
Come on.

196
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,400
The view is incredible.

197
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:46,640
It's beautiful.

198
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:47,360
Yeah.

199
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,720
Give it a try. It's so good.

200
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,560
P'Ing, why don't you have a seat?

201
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,640
Watch out.

202
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:15,600
Yok,

203
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,160
do you think there are any sharks?

204
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,800
I'm sleepy. I'll get some shut-eye.

205
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,640
I bet there's one.

206
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,520
You're shark bait for sure.

207
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:33,840
-Want to jump in? -Hey.

208
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,320
How's the internship going?

209
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,200
It's okay.

210
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,600
How about boxing?

211
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,800
Same as always.

212
00:14:43,280 --> 00:14:44,160
I've got it under control.

213
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,720
That's good to hear.

214
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:29,720
I like you.

215
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,480
-But I'm not like that. -I know.

216
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:33,120
Whether I like women or not,

217
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:35,520
there's no way we could be together.

218
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,520
P'Ing...

219
00:17:13,319 --> 00:17:14,079
Itt...

220
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:21,200
Go away.

221
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:33,200
Itt...

222
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:34,440
Itt...

223
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:35,640
Wait.

224
00:17:54,560 --> 00:17:55,560
What the hell?

225
00:17:57,560 --> 00:17:58,680
Itt, wait for me.

226
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:07,200
Itt, hey.

227
00:18:07,360 --> 00:18:08,080
Itt...

228
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,000
What are you doing?

229
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,080
It's not what you think.

230
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:13,840
What do you think I'm thinking?

231
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,080
I don't feel anything for P'Ing.

232
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:20,120
I know I have no right to say this,

233
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,080
but if you want to date P'Ing,

234
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:22,800
I just want to warn you

235
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:23,720
that he never loves anyone.

236
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,840
I'm afraid you'll get hurt.

237
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:27,600
Itt, I seriously don't like P'Ing.

238
00:18:28,320 --> 00:18:29,120
I actually like...

239
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,160
That's enough.

240
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,720
I don't want to hear it.

241
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,120
You should leave.

242
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:39,040
I need some time alone.

243
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:41,760
Itt...

244
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:15,960
P'Ing...

245
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:20,800
Itt...

246
00:20:09,320 --> 00:20:11,040
I was planning to talk to him

247
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:12,800
about wanting to intern at Araya Group

248
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,480
so I can work hard and prove myself.

249
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:15,840
Maybe he'll start to see me in a better light.

250
00:20:16,560 --> 00:20:18,200
Put Itt

251
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,800
in Corporate Development.

252
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:21,680
As for Yok, stay here in this office.

253
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:23,360
You'll be my personal assistant.

254
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,160
Yok,

255
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:25,480
what's going on between you and P'Ing?

256
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:26,520
Nothing's going on.

257
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:33,320
Itt...

258
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,680
Excuse me, stop right there.

259
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:53,040
I need to check your pocket.

260
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:54,400
It looks like you took something

261
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:55,840
but haven't paid for it yet.

262
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,320
I didn't take it.

263
00:20:57,960 --> 00:21:00,680
If you didn't take it, then just let me search you.

264
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,520
Or do you want me to call the police?

265
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:03,640
Show me your pocket.

266
00:21:05,360 --> 00:21:06,160
Hey.

267
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:09,080
Seeing that he's alone,

268
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:10,320
you're acting all tough, huh?

269
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:13,520
What right do you have to search him?

270
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:15,160
Are you a cop?

271
00:21:17,280 --> 00:21:18,800
If something's missing, check the cameras.

272
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:24,080
-The cameras happen to be broken. -Oh...

273
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:26,440
Then you have no evidence.

274
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:29,080
Accusing someone like this...

275
00:21:30,080 --> 00:21:31,600
If the police actually come,

276
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:34,400
you will be in trouble.

277
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:39,280
Filing a false report can land you in jail.

278
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,280
Looking for this?

279
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:24,200
What do you want?

280
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:34,000
Don't be so mean.

281
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:44,280
You want it?

282
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:47,480
Why did you help me?

283
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:52,120
I used to steal candy just like you.

284
00:22:56,080 --> 00:22:57,000
Is it really possible...

285
00:22:58,200 --> 00:22:59,800
to be so hungry that you're forced to steal?

286
00:23:11,360 --> 00:23:12,640
My parents died young,

287
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:15,600
so I had to go live with relatives.

288
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,640
Every time I had a meal,

289
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:20,320
I didn't dare eat much.

290
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,640
I didn't want to be a burden.

291
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:25,880
Sometimes...

292
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:28,520
I was so hungry I'd bite my nails off to eat.

293
00:23:32,280 --> 00:23:33,320
But in the end,

294
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,520
no one really wanted to take me in.

295
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:39,360
Still, I never blamed them.

296
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:43,200
It wasn't their job to look after me, after all.

297
00:23:46,360 --> 00:23:47,600
But a kid's gotta grow.

298
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,840
When I couldn't stand the hunger,

299
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:54,400
I'd sneak out and steal something to eat.

300
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:57,800
What about you?

301
00:23:59,560 --> 00:24:00,840
Is something stressing you out?

302
00:24:09,080 --> 00:24:10,240
My parents are still around.

303
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:13,120
My family isn't struggling.

304
00:24:15,720 --> 00:24:16,560
Seriously?

305
00:24:18,560 --> 00:24:19,920
That makes my life so miserable.

306
00:24:26,040 --> 00:24:26,960
But there's this one person...

307
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:30,280
who's so talented.

308
00:24:31,600 --> 00:24:34,680
He's someone I could never catch up to,

309
00:24:37,040 --> 00:24:37,960
but he...

310
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:40,760
absolutely hates my guts.

311
00:25:28,640 --> 00:25:29,360
Who is it?

312
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,200
It's me.

313
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:32,200
Who?

314
00:25:32,800 --> 00:25:33,680
It's me.

315
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:48,080
Wait, what the hell is wrong with you?

316
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:51,560
What's gotten into you?

317
00:25:51,560 --> 00:25:53,080
What did you mean by what you said that day?

318
00:25:53,600 --> 00:25:54,240
Tell me.

319
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,720
You said we'd only talk about work.

320
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:58,440
What was all that at the beach today?

321
00:25:58,800 --> 00:25:59,600
Oh...

322
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:01,520
Why?

323
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:03,160
You just believe everything I say?

324
00:26:03,320 --> 00:26:06,520
Whoa, I didn't know the heir to the Sukonsiri family

325
00:26:06,560 --> 00:26:08,560
was this stupid. You're so damn easy to trick.

326
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:10,240
Let me tell you something.

327
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,680
When I want something,

328
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:14,160
I'll make sure I get it.

329
00:26:15,280 --> 00:26:17,600
Fine, I'll make you get over me.

330
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:20,120
Is that so? How?

331
00:26:20,160 --> 00:26:20,800
Show me.

332
00:26:20,800 --> 00:26:22,560
Can someone like you really pull it off?

333
00:26:31,120 --> 00:26:31,880
I see.

334
00:26:32,320 --> 00:26:34,520
Violence is how you solve problems, huh?

335
00:26:45,320 --> 00:26:46,120
Yok.

336
00:26:51,280 --> 00:26:52,600
Do you have no shame at all?

337
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:55,920
Hey, stop acting so innocent.

338
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:56,680
To be honest,

339
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,680
the fact that I'm even into you

340
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:59,120
is the best thing that's ever happened to you.

341
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:00,320
Mark my words.

342
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:03,080
If I don't get to have you at least once,

343
00:27:03,080 --> 00:27:04,640
I'll gladly stay beneath you forever.

344
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:16,480
Are you sure you can pull that off?

345
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,200
Why?

346
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,800
You think I can't pull it off?

347
00:27:19,080 --> 00:27:20,200
Try me. Take off your pants

348
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:21,880
and let me have you just once.

349
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:24,320
I'm telling you...

350
00:27:25,320 --> 00:27:26,720
The first time, you might like it.

351
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:28,320
But by the second time,

352
00:27:28,840 --> 00:27:30,480
you won't be able to get me out of your head.

353
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:34,600
Hey...

354
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:36,680
Dammit, can you take it easy?

355
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:45,760
Well, well.

356
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,600
Look how worked up you are.

357
00:27:48,600 --> 00:27:49,840
Just from a little touch,

358
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:51,080
and your little guy is already waking up?

359
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:54,080
Acting all cool like you don't like it.

360
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,800
P'Ing, stop it now.

361
00:27:57,280 --> 00:27:58,520
Oh, you want me to stop?

362
00:27:58,560 --> 00:27:59,800
Fine. Then let me go

363
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:01,600
and arch your back so I can have you.

364
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:02,360
P'Ing,

365
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:03,680
if you don't shut your mouth,

366
00:28:03,840 --> 00:28:05,680
I'll make you regret it for the rest of your life.

367
00:28:05,920 --> 00:28:07,160
You think I'm scared?

368
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:08,480
Go for it.

369
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,320
You wouldn't have the guts.

370
00:28:13,760 --> 00:28:14,920
You asked for this.

371
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:17,320
Yok...

372
00:28:18,080 --> 00:28:20,080
Wait, why are you tying me up?

373
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:26,000
Yok, untie me this instant.

374
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,760
Where are you going?

375
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:34,560
Hey, get back here and untie me.

376
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:39,320
Yok...

377
00:28:39,840 --> 00:28:41,080
What do you think you're doing?

378
00:28:41,560 --> 00:28:42,680
I've never been a bottom.

379
00:28:45,680 --> 00:28:46,480
So what?

380
00:28:48,280 --> 00:28:49,400
Tonight, you'll find out

381
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:50,680
who's meant to be the bottom.

382
00:29:01,200 --> 00:29:02,320
Yok, you...

383
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,280
Yok,

384
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,560
you son of a...

385
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:22,600
Still got a smart mouth?

386
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:26,320
Is that all you've got? You're pathetic.

387
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:34,920
You're the only one who wants me on the bottom.

388
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:37,880
I'd only ever let you do that to me.

389
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:29,080
Yok...

390
00:30:42,080 --> 00:30:43,680
What did you mean by what you said that day?

391
00:30:45,880 --> 00:30:46,680
Yok...

392
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:03,560
Come in.

393
00:31:12,160 --> 00:31:14,280
The fact that you didn't run away last night

394
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:16,000
shows that you have a shred of decency.

395
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:19,960
I brought you some medicine.

396
00:31:23,040 --> 00:31:23,760
Why?

397
00:31:25,120 --> 00:31:25,960
Feeling guilty?

398
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:27,960
Is that why you brought me this medicine?

399
00:31:29,600 --> 00:31:30,600
Dammit.

400
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:33,800
What are you doing?

401
00:31:35,200 --> 00:31:37,440
I should be asking what you are doing.

402
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:38,800
Why?

403
00:31:39,560 --> 00:31:40,160
Sleeping with me

404
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:42,160
is that embarrassing to you?

405
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:45,160
Don't touch me.

406
00:31:45,760 --> 00:31:46,920
You should just...

407
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:48,360
go to hell.

408
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:56,200
If you're in pain, just take the medicine.

409
00:31:57,320 --> 00:31:58,680
I think you're the one...

410
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:00,880
who needs a heavy dose of conscience.

411
00:32:02,360 --> 00:32:04,520
It's not like I'm pretending nothing happened.

412
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:06,080
-We were both drunk last night. -Oh...

413
00:32:06,080 --> 00:32:07,080
It was just an accident.

414
00:32:07,080 --> 00:32:08,800
We were drunk? No, you were drunk.

415
00:32:10,080 --> 00:32:11,040
Let me ask you something.

416
00:32:11,560 --> 00:32:13,440
If you have even an ounce of manhood in you,

417
00:32:13,440 --> 00:32:14,720
start using your brain.

418
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:16,040
Don't you remember

419
00:32:16,040 --> 00:32:17,000
when you were on top of me,

420
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:18,040
moaning,

421
00:32:18,080 --> 00:32:18,840
your whole body turned pink

422
00:32:18,840 --> 00:32:20,480
like a damn pink Teletubby?

423
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:21,800
Do you remember that?

424
00:32:22,600 --> 00:32:24,360
I turned you down so many times,

425
00:32:24,560 --> 00:32:26,200
but you wouldn't leave me alone.

426
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:28,800
Turned me down? I didn't leave you alone?

427
00:32:28,800 --> 00:32:30,440
You didn't leave me alone. Look at these marks.

428
00:32:30,800 --> 00:32:32,040
You tied my arms up with a rope

429
00:32:32,040 --> 00:32:32,840
and took me.

430
00:32:32,840 --> 00:32:33,760
You did this, didn't you?

431
00:32:34,480 --> 00:32:36,040
You broke your promise first, didn't you?

432
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:39,920
Okay.

433
00:32:40,720 --> 00:32:41,800
I just lost my temper.

434
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:43,640
I'll take responsibility for what I did.

435
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:46,280
I'll take you to a hotel for a few days.

436
00:32:46,720 --> 00:32:48,240
We can't let anyone see you like this.

437
00:32:48,280 --> 00:32:50,440
Oh, so this is your idea of taking responsibility?

438
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:52,080
Can't let anyone see me like this?

439
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:53,360
What do you mean?

440
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:01,080
Can we deal with the immediate problem first?

441
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,120
You call P'Phet

442
00:33:02,120 --> 00:33:03,840
and tell him we have something urgent in Bangkok.

443
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:05,520
I'll drop you off at your place,

444
00:33:05,760 --> 00:33:06,840
and then we're done.

445
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:09,520
Oh, that's a brilliant solution.

446
00:33:09,560 --> 00:33:11,480
Fine, I'm calling your brother

447
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:13,440
to tell him his little brother slept with me.

448
00:33:13,600 --> 00:33:14,400
How about that?

449
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:16,640
Or should we just get married?

450
00:33:17,240 --> 00:33:18,560
Where the hell is my phone?

451
00:33:19,280 --> 00:33:21,320
You cannot tell my family.

452
00:33:21,800 --> 00:33:22,520
Why?

453
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:23,840
Are you scared?

454
00:33:25,800 --> 00:33:26,920
Are you going or not?

455
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:30,040
I'm going... to ask your brother to handle this.

456
00:33:30,080 --> 00:33:31,920
If he doesn't, I'll tell your father.

457
00:33:31,960 --> 00:33:32,680
Sound good?

458
00:33:35,600 --> 00:33:36,400
Go ahead.

459
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,200
It would be quite a scandal...

460
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:41,840
if people found out that Mr. Ing, the great CEO,

461
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:43,720
had to bottom for the first time.

462
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,640
Oh, I'm so scared.

463
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:49,080
Do you think...

464
00:33:49,080 --> 00:33:50,480
I'd be afraid of something like that?

465
00:33:54,360 --> 00:33:55,360
Reporters?

466
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:57,280
I have hundreds of connections.

467
00:33:57,280 --> 00:33:57,840
Just one call

468
00:33:57,880 --> 00:33:58,720
and they'd be here right now.

469
00:33:58,760 --> 00:33:59,560
Bring it on.

470
00:33:59,600 --> 00:34:00,680
You want to play games with me?

471
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:02,960
Do you really think this can scare me?

472
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:06,240
What exactly do you want?

473
00:34:06,480 --> 00:34:07,400
It's simple.

474
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:08,280
Turn around, take your pants off,

475
00:34:08,320 --> 00:34:09,440
let me have you, and then we're done.

476
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:11,880
Not a chance.

477
00:34:18,040 --> 00:34:18,360
[Mr. Phet]

478
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:20,400
It's your brother. Deal with him.

479
00:34:25,800 --> 00:34:27,360
Come on, just own up to it.

480
00:34:29,159 --> 00:34:29,960
Take it.

481
00:34:30,520 --> 00:34:31,239
What?

482
00:34:31,960 --> 00:34:32,840
You took me last night,

483
00:34:32,840 --> 00:34:34,080
and now you want me to take this?

484
00:34:34,199 --> 00:34:35,199
Are you out of your mind?

485
00:34:36,480 --> 00:34:37,560
I thought you said you were a man.

486
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:39,199
Go on, talk to your brother.

487
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:41,040
Yeah, right. You're too scared.

488
00:34:43,639 --> 00:34:44,560
Hello, Mr. Phet.

489
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:46,520
Mr. Ing, I heard that

490
00:34:46,560 --> 00:34:47,679
you went to the beach yesterday.

491
00:34:47,719 --> 00:34:48,600
Did you have a good time?

492
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:49,880
Yes, I did.

493
00:34:50,199 --> 00:34:52,280
And to be honest, your brother...

494
00:34:52,600 --> 00:34:54,760
was particularly energetic.

495
00:35:00,160 --> 00:35:01,680
I was actually just about to call you.

496
00:35:01,960 --> 00:35:02,880
What is it?

497
00:35:11,720 --> 00:35:12,800
Well, the thing is...

498
00:35:14,120 --> 00:35:15,800
there's an urgent matter, Mr. Phet.

499
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:20,120
The office in Bangkok is dealing with a few issues,

500
00:35:20,160 --> 00:35:22,000
so Yok and I have to rush back.

501
00:35:22,040 --> 00:35:23,920
A lot of people are taking time off.

502
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:25,560
We have to go clear some urgent business.

503
00:35:25,880 --> 00:35:27,880
That's quite a coincidence.

504
00:35:28,240 --> 00:35:29,920
Yeah, I was surprised myself.

505
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:31,280
It's quite a coincidence.

506
00:35:33,960 --> 00:35:35,160
How about this, Mr. Phet?

507
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:37,040
Since Yok needs to help me in Bangkok,

508
00:35:37,080 --> 00:35:38,600
I'll send Itt

509
00:35:38,640 --> 00:35:40,160
to survey the site with you instead.

510
00:35:40,200 --> 00:35:43,240
Think of it as a temporary brother swap.

511
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:45,440
Sure, you can take him.

512
00:35:45,480 --> 00:35:45,960
Understood.

513
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:48,800
Well, is there anything you want me to tell Yok?

514
00:35:48,880 --> 00:35:50,320
I can pass the message along for you.

515
00:35:54,080 --> 00:35:54,800
Okay.

516
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:56,800
Alright, goodbye.

517
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:06,200
Itt, Yok and I are going back to Bangkok first.

518
00:36:06,240 --> 00:36:07,200
Something urgent came up.

519
00:36:07,240 --> 00:36:09,160
You go survey the site with Mr. Phet

520
00:36:09,200 --> 00:36:10,880
and make sure you send all the data to me.

521
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,080
Did you tell Itt...

522
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:17,720
anything about what happened between us

523
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:18,680
yesterday?

524
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:21,160
That's what you wanna know now?

525
00:36:22,560 --> 00:36:24,040
Get things straight with him.

526
00:36:24,520 --> 00:36:26,720
Fine, I'll tell him that

527
00:36:26,880 --> 00:36:28,640
we have no feelings for each other

528
00:36:28,680 --> 00:36:30,880
and there's nothing going on. Sound good?

529
00:36:35,160 --> 00:36:36,160
Put some clothes on.

530
00:36:36,720 --> 00:36:37,560
The car is about to leave.

531
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:42,040
What kind of outfit is this?

532
00:36:42,400 --> 00:36:43,560
You have zero taste.

533
00:36:49,720 --> 00:36:50,960
Grab the underwear while you're at it.

534
00:36:51,920 --> 00:36:53,880
Are you expecting me to go without underwear?

535
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:54,720
Are you some kind of pervert?

536
00:37:15,720 --> 00:37:16,520
[Egress Window]

537
00:37:16,520 --> 00:37:19,280
Dammit, why do we have to take the fire escape?

538
00:37:19,320 --> 00:37:21,280
And you went so hard on me last night.

539
00:37:21,280 --> 00:37:22,400
How am I supposed to walk down?

540
00:37:22,680 --> 00:37:24,000
Taking the elevator is too risky.

541
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:25,000
Risky how?

542
00:37:25,040 --> 00:37:26,200
Nobody's gonna notice me in this outfit.

543
00:37:26,240 --> 00:37:27,560
No one's going to care.

544
00:37:28,120 --> 00:37:30,160
P'Ing, can you just stop complaining?

545
00:37:31,240 --> 00:37:32,040
Dammit.

546
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:37,040
How many more floors are there?

547
00:37:37,120 --> 00:37:37,920
Let me help.

548
00:37:37,960 --> 00:37:38,640
No way.

549
00:37:38,680 --> 00:37:41,200
What if you suddenly shove me down the stairs?

550
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,320
I don't trust you.

551
00:37:50,360 --> 00:37:51,560
Do you like Yok?

552
00:37:54,600 --> 00:37:56,800
That face of yours doesn't just belong to you.

553
00:37:56,920 --> 00:37:58,880
It carries the name of the Sukonsiri family.

554
00:37:59,120 --> 00:38:01,120
Isn't Yok supposed to be handling this project?

555
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:04,520
Yes, but he's currently on leave.

556
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:06,280
Let go of me.

557
00:38:07,680 --> 00:38:08,440
Why?

558
00:38:08,560 --> 00:38:10,600
You have no right to touch my mom's shares.

559
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:16,840
Why won't you just give up on this already?
